```

But canvas mousedown already requests pointer lock in input.js on mousedown (non-touch). So this extra global handler is redundant. Remove requestPointerLock from UI global pointerdown or restrict to e.target === canvas. Actually input.js `canvas.addEventListener('mousedown')` requests pointer lock. So UI handler can just init audio. We'll remove pointer lock request. That will fix spectate click and also buttons in HUD while match.

